    "describe_ch": "本課程著重在都市規劃的環境資料調查、整理與分析之實務操作，並讓學生在分組團隊合作中觀察與體驗空間環境，作為都市規劃實務的基礎訓練。",
    "describe_eh": "This course focuses on the professional practice of environmental information survey, categorization, and analysis in urban planning. It is intended to train students the way to observe and experience spatial envieonment by means of team working, as the basic understanding of urban planning practice.\r\n",
